eding stable result holds."}],"premises":[{"id":"n05","text":"Rules r00, r14, r12, r05 are declared."},{"id":"n06","text":"Rules r03, r07, r08 are declared."},{"id":"n19","text":"Rules r06, r10, r13 are declared."},{"id":"n09","text":"unit5 is bundled; unit5 is retained; unit5 is packed; unit5 is mounted; unit5 is routed; unit5 is rated; unit5 is checked. The checks that unit5 is stacked and unit5 is coded and unit5 is scanned remain unassumed."},{"id":"n11","text":"Rules r09, r04, r11 are declared."},{"id":"n21","text":"Rules r01, r02, r15 are declared."}],"records":[{"id":"r08","text":"If unit1 is cleared (payment settled), then unit5 is balanced."},{"id":"r09","text":"If unit3 is ready (packing completed) and unit5 is ready (packing completed), then unit5 is weighed-in."},{"id":"r03","text":"If unit5 is mounted and unit5 is routed and unit5 is rated, then unit3 is ready (packing completed). If unit5 is tied and unit5 is boxed, then unit3 is ready (packing completed)."},{"id":"r01","text":"If unit5 is weighed-in, then unit3 is sound (casing intact)."},{"id":"r15","text":"If unit3 is stable (shape retained) and unit5 is stacked, then unit1 is stable (temperature constant). If unit3 is stable (shape retained) and unit5 is checked, then unit1 is stable (shape retained). If unit3 is stable (shape retained) and unit5 is coded, then unit5 is stable (temperature constant). If unit3 is stable (shape retained) and unit5 is scanned, then unit5 is stable (shape retained)."},{"id":"r11","text":"If unit3 is stable (temperature constant), then unit3 is stable (shape retained)."},{"id":"r04","text":"If unit5 is logged, then unit3 is cleared (inspection passed)."},{"id":"r00","text":"If unit5 is bundled and unit5 is retained and unit5 is packed, then unit3 is ready (staffing arranged). If unit5 is tied and unit5 is boxed, then unit3 is ready (staffing arranged). Lot unit5 supplied sample unit1."},{"id":"r12","text":"If unit3 is cleared (payment settled), then unit1 is cleared (payment settled)."},{"id":"r13","text":"If unit5 is balanced, then unit3 is stable (temperature constant)."},{"id":"r07","text":"If unit3 is sound (signal audible), then unit5 is sound (signal audible)."},{"id":"r05","text":"If unit5 is stable (shape retained), then unit5 is calibrated. If unit5 is tied and unit5 is boxed, then unit5 is calibrated."},{"id":"r02","text":"If unit3 is cleared (inspection passed), then unit3 is cleared (payment settled)."},{"id":"r06","text":"If unit3 is ready (staffing arranged) and unit3 is ready (packing completed), then unit5 is ready (packing completed)."},{"id":"r14","text":"If unit3 is sound (casing intact), then unit3 is sound (signal audible)."},{"id":"r10","text":"If unit5 is sound (signal audible), then unit5 is logged."}],"root":"n14"}
